Detector: divide-before-multiply
PackVault._settleHolder(address) (src/PackVault.sol#529-563) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- minted = uint256(d.amount - d.charge) * epochSupply[d.epoch] / epochNav[d.epoch] (src/PackVault.sol#533)
	- distDebt[h] += minted * epochDistPerShare[d.epoch] / 1e18 (src/PackVault.sol#536)
VaultLib.edge(VaultLib.Params,IFWAV2,address,uint256) (src/VaultLib.sol#284-298) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- backing = cap * (BPS - p.bufferBps) / BPS (src/VaultLib.sol#292)
	- ok = cap != 0 && k1e18 >= 1e18 + uint256(p.minEdgeBps) * 1e14 && k1e18 > s * 1e14 && backing * (k1e18 - s * 1e14) >= units * UNIT * 1e18 (src/VaultLib.sol#295-296)
VaultLib.economics(IFWAV2,address) (src/VaultLib.sol#385-407) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- k1e18 = oneSur * (BPS - f.ownerAcquisitionFeeBps()) / BPS * (BPS - f.topListingShareBps()) / BPS (src/VaultLib.sol#392)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

